As the FPD has been in use since 2003, it has been incorporated into the STAR specific version of the Geant3 package, called GSTAR. (**GE**ometry **AN**d **T**racking is a detector response simulator developed by CERN. The newer, C\({}^{++}\) based Geant4, which addresses at least one issue of Geant3 discussed later, has not been imple

