\[\begin{split} V_{C4}(min)&=V_{C4}(max)-(N-2)\cdot\delta V \\ &=V_{input}-(3N-1-2)\cdot\delta V\end{split}\] (A.26)

The pattern is clear. We proceed to derive the equation for the output voltage by adding voltages across all odd numbered capacitors as before.

\[\begin{split} V_{out}=& V_{input}-N\cdot\delta V+\\ & V_{input}-\{2N-1\}\cdot\delta V+\\ & V_{input}-\{3N-(1+2)\}\cdot\delta V+\\ & V_{input}-\{4N-(1+2+3)\}\cdot\delta V+\\ &\cdots\\ =& N\cdot V_{input}-\sum_{i}^{N}\Big{\{}i\cdot N-\sum_{k}^{i -1}k\Big{\}}\cdot\delta V\\ =& N\cdot V_{input}-\frac{1}{2}\sum_{i}^{N}\Big{\{}-i ^{2}+(2N+1)i\Big{\}}\cdot\delta V\\ =& N\cdot V_{input}-\frac{1}{6}\cdot\Big{\{}2N^{3}+ 3N^{2}+N\Big{\}}\cdot\delta V\end{split}\] (A.27)

